    <item>
      <title>48 Hours in the Singapore With No Smartphone</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-04/48-hours-in-the-singapore-with-no-smartphone-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">f3d9f98775afd909e74aa73c</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 13:28:53 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Bloomberg Pursuits Senior Features Writer Thu-Huong Ha tells Bloomberg This Weekend about spending 48 hours in Singapore without relying on a smartphone, navigating a city where transportation, payments, dining and government services are deeply integrated with digital technology. Speaking with hosts David Gura and Christina Ruffini, Ha says the experiment required more patience and effort but also made her more observant of her surroundings and convinced her there is value in experiencing boredom without immediately reaching for a screen. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
